R VIEW E-E AND THE CHEEK WALL SECTIONS F-F AND G-G, SEE SHEET B4-8. FOR LOCATION OF VIEWS D-D AND E-E, SEE PLAN.\P4. THE CHEEK WALLS ARE SHOWN BROKEN IN THE ELEVATION AND WHOLE IN VIEW D-D AND ON SHEET B4-8.\P5. PIER WALL IS PROVISIONAL (3'-0" THICK)
  1
; ITS REINFORCEMENT IS NOT SHOWN.\P6. FOR REINFORCING BAR LIST, SEE SHEET B4-13.\P7. PILE OFFSETS ARE FROM THE PGL, + TO THE RIGHT LOOKING UP-STATION. CUTOFF ELEVATIONS ARE TO THE NEAREST 0.1 FT.
